{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[I haven't had time to update this game for a while, and as a result I'm making it free]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORDIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The premise of wordies is simple, you're randomly assigned the task of guessing a commonly used American word. But with only 5 tries, Wordies is harder than it </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> looks. Wordies also features a Daily Word &amp; a global highstreak leaderboard where you can compete with not only your friends but the rest of the world to be the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> When guessing you're given 3 different clues in the form of colors to help you along your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Gray</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter you've chosen does not appear in the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Orange</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter you've entered is in the word, but appears in a different place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Green</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Indicates the letter is in the correct place, but there is still the possibility of it appearing twice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build up winstreaks, fustrate yourself, &amp; challenge friends all in an hour of wordies!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tactical Guesser!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1905310/8e56f54587e87dda56792babb40eed052c4554be.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Nerd!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1905310/7a9169704e416d609976b464dcb186bc17bded32.jpg"},{"name":"A Work In Progress!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c